OL,3,GNEWSASchools built using private money 
OL,4,Acost executive an extra #1bn           
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Executive will pay
OL,7,Fover #1bn more for 19 schools than they
OL,8,Factually cost to build.                
OL,10,FThe schools in Belfast, County Down,   
OL,11,FCounty Antrim, County Tyrone and County
OL,12,FLondonderry were all built in the early
OL,13,F2000s using the Private Finance        
OL,14,FInitiative (PFI) model.                
OL,16,FThat meant the executive did not pay   
OL,17,Ffor the new buildings but contracted   
OL,18,Ffirms to build and maintain them.      
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
