OL,3,GNEWSASchools built using private money 
OL,4,Acost executive an extra #1bn           
OL,6,FThe Education Minister Paul Givan told 
OL,7,FBBC News NI that his department was    
OL,8,Fstill paying millions of pounds for the
OL,9,Fcontracts. He also said that he        
OL,10,Fbelieved the PFI scheme was "flawed."  
